menu "FoloToy AI Passport Wi-Fi"

config APP_WIFI_SSID
    string "Wi-Fi SSID (empty disables auto-connect)"
    default ""
    help
        Station SSID used by the Wi-Fi demo and optional boot
        auto-connect. Leave empty to keep the pure scan-only
        behavior without joining any network.

config APP_WIFI_PASSWORD
    string "Wi-Fi password (local only, never commit)"
    default ""
    help
        Station password for APP_WIFI_SSID. Configure it locally
        with "idf.py menuconfig" (stored in the ignored sdkconfig),
        never in sdkconfig.defaults or any committed file, and never
        print it in logs.

config APP_WIFI_AUTOCONNECT
    bool "Connect at boot when SSID is set"
    default y
    help
        When enabled and APP_WIFI_SSID is non-empty, the device
        brings up Wi-Fi STA in the background at boot and keeps it
        connected across demo pages. Page exit does not tear it
        down; idle shutdown still force-stops it before deep sleep.

endmenu
